  "title": "Pink Sauce for Pasta (Shrimp)",
  "description": "This beautiful pink shrimp sauce made with cream, tomato, cayenne pepper, cumin, and lemon pairs perfectly with any kind of pasta.",
  "authors": [
    "MARBALET"
  ],
